Every removed edge key read back per site (`pair_churn.py`): losses are false matches the real variable now shadows (cilium 128 `entry: DenyEntry`, 93 `AllowEntry`, 96 `tick` argument -> `Watcher.tick`; beads `Commit` -> `DoltStore.Commit`) plus, on cilium, 3 `entry.updated.Unix()` calls on a `time.Time` that used to bind to an unrelated in-repo `Unix` function and now read `external`, and 1 `nowFunc: time.Now` field value that used to bind to an in-repo `Now`. On alertmanager 134 placeholder and 114 luckily-resolved dot-imported calls now bind to the alias variable, and 37 more resolve to the dot-imported package's real functions. Zero resolved -> unresolved transitions remain after fix 2 (`churn_*.txt`).

